User Table:
Id - Primary key
first_name, last_name - Your “two names”; separate columns make sorting and greeting easier
email (unique), phone - How the person can be reached and can log in
password_hash - Scrambled password, never the real one
role - customer or admin
neighbourhood_id - Foreign key to neighbourhoods
notify_sms, notify_email - Notification choices
created_at - When the account was made

Location:
County ID -> HAS a relationship of 1 to manyhence 1 county many towns
Each town has multiple neighbourhoods it has the same rekationship
one to many.

